    <briefdescription>
<para>Sample best solutions using BranchAndBound. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Find all good configurations of the model using branch and bound. Searches are truncated when the score is worse than the thresholds in the Sampler or when two particles with the same ParticlesState are assigned the same state. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
